[[1,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891180\">1004D10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892328\">1004D40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892342\">1020A24</a></p><p>1. Undo the fixing bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the engine oil pump (2a) complete with draught device\n(2b).</p><p>3. Recover the oil pump gasket.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034556.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Replace the oil pump gasket.</p><p>Position the oil pump fitting the drive\nshaft in its housing.</p><p>Tighten the bolts fixing the oil pump to\nthe cylinder block/crankcase to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>ENGINE OIL PUMP</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2892342\">1020A24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892328\">1004D40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891180\">1004D10</a></p>"]]